  "abstract": null,
  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-YdBSXA5m\">如果您是第一次接触MCP Server，不用担心！本指南将用最简单的方式，带您从零开始掌握这个强大的智能工具。</p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-BkR00lIH\" id=\"h346b9f0-BkR00lIH\">入门指南</h1><h2 data-id=\"h490b8bf-KDiMU4Jg\" id=\"h490b8bf-KDiMU4Jg\">什么是MCP Server？</h2><p data-id=\"p838747a-XwO5o0Fe\">MCP Server是开放平台提供的工具服务，能帮助AI模型直接连接您的业务系统（如巨量千川账户、投放数据平台等），让AI具备<strong>自动查询数据、加工信息、执行简单业务操作</strong>的能力，无需您手动介入中间环节。</p><h2 data-id=\"h490b8bf-3RfgYTP2\" id=\"h490b8bf-3RfgYTP2\">为什么需要MCP Server？</h2><p data-id=\"p838747a-Ff2bNfoQ\">要理解MCP Server的真正价值，让我们看看在使用AI对话时，有MCP Server和没有MCP Server的巨大能力差异：</p><h3 data-id=\"h6f20189-NTjnWW6a\" id=\"h6f20189-NTjnWW6a\">❌ 没有MCP Server的AI（功能受限）</h3><p data-id=\"p838747a-rT8Dy4ZY\">想象一下，您正在与一个智能助手对话，但它却：</p><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view qz-codeblock qz-card-type-block\" data-type=\"codeblock\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22wrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22language%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22theme%22%3A%22QZtheme%22%2C%22height%22%3A%22auto%22%2C%22text%22%3A%221%F0%9F%98%94%20%E6%82%A8%EF%BC%9A%5C%22%E8%AF%B7%E5%B8%AE%E6%88%91%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90%E6%9C%AC%E6%9C%88%E5%90%84%E6%8A%95%E6%94%BE%E8%B4%A6%E6%88%B7%E7%9A%84%E6%8A%95%E6%94%BE%E6%95%88%E6%9E%9C%5C%22%5Cn2%F0%9F%A4%96%20AI%EF%BC%9A%5C%22%E5%BE%88%E6%8A%B1%E6%AD%89%EF%BC%8C%E6%88%91%E6%97%A0%E6%B3%95%E8%8E%B7%E5%8F%96%E6%82%A8%E7%9A%84%E5%AE%9E%E6%97%B6%E6%8A%95%E6%94%BE%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E3%80%82%E6%88%91%E5%8F%AA%E8%83%BD%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%E4%B8%80%E8%88%AC%E6%80%A7%E7%9A%84%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90%E5%BB%BA%E8%AE%AE...%5C%22%5Cn3%5Cn4%F0%9F%98%94%20%E6%82%A8%EF%BC%9A%5C%22%E6%88%91%E7%9A%84%E8%B4%A6%E6%88%B7%E9%A2%84%E7%AE%97%E8%8A%B1%E5%BE%97%E5%A4%AA%E5%BF%AB%EF%BC%8C%E8%83%BD%E6%9F%A5%E7%9C%8B%E6%98%AF%E5%93%AA%E4%B8%AA%20campaigns%20%E6%B6%88%E8%80%97%E6%9C%80%E5%A4%9A%E5%90%97%EF%BC%9F%5C%22%5Cn5%F0%9F%A4%96%20AI%EF%BC%9A%5C%22%E6%88%91%E6%97%A0%E6%B3%95%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E6%9F%A5%E7%9C%8B%E6%82%A8%E7%9A%84%E8%B4%A6%E6%88%B7%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%EF%BC%8C%E5%BB%BA%E8%AE%AE%E6%82%A8%E6%89%8B%E5%8A%A8%E7%99%BB%E5%BD%95%E6%8A%95%E6%94%BE%E5%B9%B3%E5%8F%B0%E6%A3%80%E6%9F%A5...%5C%22%5Cn6%5Cn7%F0%9F%98%94%20%E6%82%A8%EF%BC%9A%5C%22%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E7%94%9F%E6%88%90%E4%B8%80%E4%BB%BD%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E7%9A%84%E6%8E%A8%E5%B9%BF%E6%95%88%E6%9E%9C%E6%8A%A5%E5%91%8A%E5%90%97%EF%BC%9F%5C%22%5Cn8%F0%9F%A4%96%20AI%EF%BC%9A%5C%22%E6%88%91%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E5%91%8A%E8%AF%89%E6%82%A8%E6%8A%A5%E5%91%8A%E5%BA%94%E8%AF%A5%E5%8C%85%E5%90%AB%E5%93%AA%E4%BA%9B%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%EF%BC%8C%E4%BD%86%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E6%82%A8%E8%87%AA%E5%B7%B1%E6%94%B6%E9%9B%86%E5%92%8C%E6%95%B4%E7%90%86%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE...%5C%22%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22NIOOX%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%7D\"><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view_contain qz-codeblock_inner\"><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view_scroll qz-codeblock-scroll\" style=\"height: auto; max-height: 600px; overflow-y: scroll;\"><div class=\"qz-codeblock_content plain\"></div></div></div></div><p data-id=\"p838747a-OX3n3pXG\">具体限制：</p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-UnKfmG3K\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-5QEU8APg\">🔒&nbsp;无法获取实时数据&nbsp;- 只能基于训练时的历史数据</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-pZXIEtDd\">🔒&nbsp;无法连接业务系统&nbsp;- 不能访问您的投放账户、CRM等</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-Jasn1v4e\">🔒&nbsp;无法执行具体操作&nbsp;- 不能查询、导出、生成报表</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-nGQsy23h\">🔒&nbsp;只能提供通用建议&nbsp;- 缺乏针对您业务的个性化分析</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-RSFtdJgr\">🔒&nbsp;无法验证实际情况&nbsp;- 不能确认您的真实数据状态</li></ul><p data-id=\"p838747a-rV12RFzB\">结果就是：AI只能给您\"纸上谈兵\"的建议，所有具体工作还是要您亲力亲为！</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-extuHJtn\"><br></p><h3 data-id=\"h6f20189-aZ3IVzYV\" id=\"h6f20189-aZ3IVzYV\">✅ 使用MCP Server的AI（获得拓展能力）</h3><p data-id=\"p838747a-v3Yp6mY0\">现在，同样的AI助手，通过MCP Server获得了\"拓展能力\"：</p><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view qz-codeblock qz-card-type-block\" data-type=\"codeblock\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22wrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22language%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22theme%22%3A%22QZtheme%22%2C%22height%22%3A%22auto%22%2C%22text%22%3A%221%F0%9F%98%8A%20%E6%82%A8%EF%BC%9A%5C%22%E8%AF%B7%E5%B8%AE%E6%88%91%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90%E6%9C%AC%E6%9C%88%E5%90%84%E6%8A%95%E6%94%BE%E8%B4%A6%E6%88%B7%E7%9A%84%E6%8A%95%E6%94%BE%E6%95%88%E6%9E%9C%5C%22%5Cn2%F0%9F%9A%80%20AI%EF%BC%9A%5C%22%E6%AD%A3%E5%9C%A8%E4%B8%BA%E6%82%A8%E6%9F%A5%E8%AF%A2%E6%89%80%E6%9C%89%E6%8A%95%E6%94%BE%E8%B4%A6%E6%88%B7%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE...%20%5Cn3%20%20%20%20%20%E6%A0%B9%E6%8D%AE%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90%EF%BC%8C%E6%82%A8%E6%9C%AC%E6%9C%88%E7%9A%84%E8%A1%A8%E7%8E%B0%E5%BE%88%E4%B8%8D%E9%94%99%EF%BC%81%5Cn4%20%20%20%20%20%F0%9F%93%8A%20%E6%80%BB%E6%8A%95%E5%85%A5%EF%BC%9A%C2%A5125%2C000%EF%BC%8C%E6%80%BB%E6%94%B6%E7%9B%8A%EF%BC%9A%C2%A5420%2C000%5Cn5%20%20%20%20%20%F0%9F%93%88%20ROI%EF%BC%9A3.4%EF%BC%88%E6%AF%94%E4%B8%8A%E6%9C%88%E6%8F%90%E5%8D%8715%25%EF%BC%89%5Cn6%20%20%20%20%20%F0%9F%8F%86%20%E6%9C%80%E4%BD%B3%E8%A1%A8%E7%8E%B0%EF%BC%9A%E6%98%A5%E5%AD%A3%E6%8E%A8%E5%B9%BF%E6%B4%BB%E5%8A%A8%EF%BC%88ROI%204.2%EF%BC%89%5C%22%5Cn7%5Cn8%F0%9F%98%8A%20%E6%82%A8%EF%BC%9A%5C%22%E6%88%91%E7%9A%84%E8%B4%A6%E6%88%B7%E9%A2%84%E7%AE%97%E8%8A%B1%E5%BE%97%E5%A4%AA%E5%BF%AB%EF%BC%8C%E8%83%BD%E6%9F%A5%E7%9C%8B%E6%98%AF%E5%93%AA%E4%B8%AA%E6%B6%88%E8%80%97%E6%9C%80%E5%A4%9A%E5%90%97%EF%BC%9F%5C%22%5Cn9%F0%9F%9A%80%20AI%EF%BC%9A%5C%22%E8%AE%A9%E6%88%91%E6%9F%A5%E7%9C%8B%E6%82%A8%E7%9A%84%E5%AE%9E%E6%97%B6%E8%B4%A6%E6%88%B7%E6%B6%88%E8%80%97...%5Cn10%20%20%20%20%20%E2%9A%A0%EF%B8%8F%20%E5%8F%91%E7%8E%B0%E5%BC%82%E5%B8%B8%EF%BC%9A'%E5%A4%8F%E5%AD%A3%E4%BF%83%E9%94%80'%E6%B4%BB%E5%8A%A8%E6%B6%88%E8%80%97%E5%BC%82%E5%B8%B8%5Cn11%20%20%20%20%20%F0%9F%92%B0%20%E8%AF%A5%E6%B4%BB%E5%8A%A8%E4%BB%8A%E6%97%A5%E6%B6%88%E8%80%97%EF%BC%9A%C2%A58%2C500%EF%BC%88%E5%8D%A0%E9%A2%84%E7%AE%9770%25%EF%BC%89%5Cn12%20%20%20%20%20%F0%9F%93%88%20%E4%BD%86%E8%BD%AC%E5%8C%96%E7%8E%87%E4%BB%851.2%25%EF%BC%8C%E5%BB%BA%E8%AE%AE%E7%AB%8B%E5%8D%B3%E8%B0%83%E6%95%B4%5C%22%5Cn13%5Cn14%F0%9F%98%8A%20%E6%82%A8%EF%BC%9A%5C%22%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E7%94%9F%E6%88%90%E4%B8%80%E4%BB%BD%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E7%9A%84%E6%8E%A8%E5%B9%BF%E6%95%88%E6%9E%9C%E6%8A%A5%E5%91%8A%E5%90%97%EF%BC%9F%5C%22%5Cn15%F0%9F%9A%80%20AI%EF%BC%9A%5C%22%E6%AD%A3%E5%9C%A8%E7%94%9F%E6%88%90%E6%82%A8%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%93%E5%B1%9E%E6%8A%A5%E5%91%8A...%5Cn16%20%20%20%20%20%E2%9C%85%20%E6%8A%A5%E5%91%8A%E5%B7%B2%E7%94%9F%E6%88%90%EF%BC%81%E5%8C%85%E5%90%AB%EF%BC%9A%5Cn17%20%20%20%20%20%E2%80%A2%2012%E4%B8%AA%E5%85%B3%E9%94%AE%E6%8C%87%E6%A0%87%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90%5Cn18%20%20%20%20%20%E2%80%A2%20%E4%B8%8E%E7%AB%9E%E5%93%81%E5%AF%B9%E6%AF%94%E5%9B%BE%E8%A1%A8%5Cn19%20%20%20%20%20%E2%80%A2%203%E4%B8%AA%E4%BC%98%E5%8C%96%E5%BB%BA%E8%AE%AE%5Cn20%20%20%20%20%20%E2%80%A2%20%E4%B8%8B%E6%9C%88%E9%A2%84%E7%AE%97%E8%A7%84%E5%88%92%E5%BB%BA%E8%AE%AE%5C%22%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22b7knq%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%7D\"><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view_contain qz-codeblock_inner\"><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view_scroll qz-codeblock-scroll\" style=\"height: auto; max-height: 600px; overflow-y: scroll;\"><div class=\"qz-codeblock_content plain\"></div></div></div></div><p data-id=\"p838747a-jQt5dP1C\">AI获得的能力：</p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-KLSujqCE\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-BF7u3r0W\">🎯&nbsp;实时数据获取&nbsp;- 即时查询您的业务数据</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-20IKaARc\">🎯&nbsp;系统无缝连接&nbsp;- 直接访问投放平台、CRM等</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-tkrzlVcq\">🎯&nbsp;自动执行操作&nbsp;- 查询、分析、生成报告一气呵成</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-DcSrFIiD\">🎯&nbsp;个性化智能分析&nbsp;- 基于您的真实数据提供专业建议</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-BP7gWMrI\">🎯&nbsp;主动发现问题&nbsp;- 自动监控和预警异常情况</li></ul><p data-id=\"p838747a-zwDMKW6m\">结果就是：AI真正成为您的\"智能业务助手\"，而不仅仅是对话工具！</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-gwahhCaJ\"><br></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-FiFBDSoE\"><strong>以下对比将清晰展示使用MCP Server与不使用时的差异</strong></p><div class=\"table-container qz-card-type-block\"><table class=\"data-table data-table-row-header\" data-id=\"t3945309-d961Y6A7\" data-custom=\"false\" data-transient-attributes=\"class\" style=\"width: 100%; outline: none; border-collapse: collapse; max-width: 100%;\" data-width=\"100%\"><colgroup data-id=\"c7104f7d-3kTHJk5U\"><col width=\"14.903299203640499%\" span=\"1\" data-id=\"c6ea8bc3-DHW1d2Cg\"><col width=\"41.63822525597269%\" span=\"1\" data-id=\"c89efd5b-Wl92NYR7\"><col width=\"43.45847554038681%\" span=\"1\" data-id=\"c5e7fd10-gUkQaQ95\"></colgroup><tbody data-id=\"t6d5e859-l6E2HeQb\"><tr data-id=\"te3adcd4-QDAThG1D\" style=\"height: 39px;\"><td rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"taee72d4-dCR5uSrd\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-9sfdUF2X\">场景环节</p></td><td rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"taee72d4-7lVVJSXI\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-9De8oQuv\">不使用MCP Server的情况</p></td><td rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t4de9f0b-CiAcLeSL\" class=\"table-last-row\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-ZAoRo97i\">使用MCP Server的情况</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"te3adcd4-WQWVHm7P\" style=\"height: 39px;\"><td rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"taee72d4-NoGwAXv0\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-jN42LyPU\">AI获取业务数据</p></td><td rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"taee72d4-oITX4oK0\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-bGs4lqc3\">AI无法直接查询您的业务账户/投放数据，需您手动登录系统导出数据，再复制给AI分析</p></td><td rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t4de9f0b-4VknRoX7\" class=\"table-last-row\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-Y5hXNcPv\">AI自动调用MCP工具，直接从业务系统获取最新数据</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"te3adcd4-ZGpVD1IZ\" style=\"height: 39px;\"><td rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"taee72d4-EPD0whXJ\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-DhXj5lbW\">数据分类加工</p></td><td rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"taee72d4-ZAtwjc8d\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-tdFOaAMr\">AI仅能基于您提供的零散数据分析，需您手动整理数据（如按行业分组账户）</p></td><td rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t4de9f0b-6DUWUXk5\" class=\"table-last-row\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-F2sWmG6d\">AI调用MCP工具自动完成数据分类、统计等加工操作</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"ta128874-HgCCggI4\" style=\"height: 61px;\"><td rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"taee72d4-56VmxaZF\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-V2wzhgsw\">业务操作落地</p></td><td rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"taee72d4-st9w4dc7\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-cWVXgBAJ\">AI给出建议后，需您手动执行（如按规则调整账户分组）</p></td><td rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"t4de9f0b-4tc8KObH\" class=\"table-last-row\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-uCyq4OND\">AI通过MCP工具直接执行简单业务操作（如自动分组账户）</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"te3adcd4-jDebUVDI\" style=\"height: 39px;\"><td rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"taeb29a0-LOjmb2Ga\" class=\"table-last-column\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-K4BZJ9H7\">AI功能边界</p></td><td rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"taeb29a0-jTX4JXGA\" class=\"table-last-column\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-AGwmifxx\">AI仅能对话答疑，无法联动业务系统，解决实际业务问题受限</p></td><td rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"tdf77321-QbVYZJUT\" class=\"table-last-column table-last-row\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-ZMWhho6w\">AI拓展为“业务助手”，可处理数据查询、分析、执行类任务</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p data-id=\"p838747a-TbzPv4Kz\"><br></p><div data-type=\"qzcard\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22borderColor%22%3A%22%23fbbfbc%22%2C%22backgroundColor%22%3A%22%23fef1f1%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%3Cp%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22otRSB%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%2C%22html%22%3A%22%3Cp%20data-id%3D%5C%22p838747a-a47eikjU%5C%22%3E%3Cstrong%3E%E6%B3%A8%E6%84%8F%E4%BA%8B%E9%A1%B9%3C%2Fstrong%3E%EF%BC%9AMCP%20Server%E5%8F%AA%E6%98%AF%3Cstrong%3E%3Cu%3E%E6%8F%90%E4%BE%9B%E6%8B%93%E5%B1%95%E8%83%BD%E5%8A%9B%E7%9A%84%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%EF%BC%8C%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F%E5%92%8C%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%E7%9A%84%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90%E8%BF%98%E6%98%AF%E7%94%B1%E6%90%AD%E9%85%8D%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E5%AE%8C%E6%88%90%3C%2Fu%3E%3C%2Fstrong%3E%EF%BC%8C%E7%9B%B8%E5%AF%B9%E4%BA%8E%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E8%BE%93%E5%87%BA%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C%EF%BC%8C%E6%82%A8%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%9A%E5%8A%A1%E5%88%A4%E6%96%AD%E4%BB%8D%E7%84%B6%E6%9C%80%E9%87%8D%E8%A6%81%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cul%20data-id%3D%5C%22u738a58b-HtouLbEv%5C%22%3E%3Cli%20data-id%3D%5C%22ld70c578-RDIA9H1f%5C%22%3E%E5%BB%BA%E8%AE%AE%E5%88%9D%E6%9C%9F%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E5%AF%B9%E6%AF%94%E9%AA%8C%E8%AF%81AI%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C%EF%BC%8C%E9%9A%8F%E7%9D%80%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E7%86%9F%E7%BB%83%EF%BC%8C%E6%82%A8%E4%BC%9A%E5%8F%91%E7%8E%B0%E6%9B%B4%E5%A4%9A%E5%88%9B%E6%96%B0%E7%94%A8%E6%B3%95%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%22%7D\"><div class=\"QZCard-container\" style=\"border-color: #fbbfbc;background-color:#fef1f1;\"><div class=\"QZCard-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 1024 1024\" version=\"1.1\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" p-id=\"13148\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\"><path d=\"M833.5 330.5C833.5 153 689.6 7.6 512 7.6S190.5 153 190.5 330.5c0 70.3 37.3 161 97.2 227.9 59.4 66.3 103.5 177.9 103.5 266.9v34.9h241.6v-34.6c0-89 44.1-200.4 103.2-266.9 60.1-67.6 97.5-166.4 97.5-228.2z\" fill=\"#FFC807\" p-id=\"13149\"></path><path d=\"M636.5 790.6l-193.9-268L596.4 202l199.2 266.4c-17.4 36.4-39.3 67.4-63.9 95.2C685.3 621 664.1 671.1 644 741l-7.5 49.6z\" fill=\"#FFB300\" p-id=\"13150\"></path><path d=\"M499.5 378.3h-82.7c-12.6 0-21.4-12.7-16.8-24.5l59.2-153c2.7-6.9 9.4-11.5 16.8-11.5h105c13.6 0 22.3 14.5 15.9 26.5l-81.5 153c-3.2 5.8-9.3 9.5-15.9 9.5z\" fill=\"#FFF8E1\" p-id=\"13151\"></path><path d=\"M466.2 518.3l160-171c12-12.8 2.9-33.7-14.6-33.7h-105c-8.7 0-16.4 5.6-19.1 13.9l-55 171c-6.6 20.4 19.1 35.5 33.7 19.8z\" fill=\"#FFF8E1\" p-id=\"13152\"></path><path d=\"M593.6 1016.4H430.4c-5.7 0-10.9-3.7-14-9.8l-22.2-44.2h235.6l-22.2 44.2c-3.1 6.1-8.3 9.8-14 9.8z\" fill=\"#455A64\" p-id=\"13153\"></path><path d=\"M625.7 980.4H398.3c-22.1 0-40.1-17.9-40.1-40.1V776.7c0-22.1 17.9-40.1 40.1-40.1h227.5c22.1 0 40.1 17.9 40.1 40.1v163.7c-0.1 22.1-18 40-40.2 40z\" fill=\"#ECEFF1\" p-id=\"13154\"></path><path d=\"M539.8 808.6H359v-36h180.8c9.9 0 18 8.1 18 18 0 10-8.1 18-18 18zM359 840.1h306v36H359zM665 943.6H494.8c-9.9 0-18-8.1-18-18s8.1-18 18-18H665v36z\" fill=\"#CFD8DC\" p-id=\"13155\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"QZCard-editor-container\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-a47eikjU\"><strong>注意事项</strong>：MCP Server只是<strong><u>提供拓展能力的工具，执行方式和内容的解析还是由搭配使用模型完成</u></strong>，相对于模型输出结果，您的业务判断仍然最重要</p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-HtouLbEv\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-RDIA9H1f\">建议初期可以对比验证AI分析结果，随着使用熟练，您会发现更多创新用法</li></ul></div></div></div><p data-id=\"p838747a-0OstuGGr\"><br></p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-m1PT44K2\" id=\"h346b9f0-m1PT44K2\">快速实践</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-ftgMrqOT\">以下以<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://aily.feishu.cn/ai/agents\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">飞书Aily</a>为例</p><h2 data-id=\"h490b8bf-RnYSQPN0\" id=\"h490b8bf-RnYSQPN0\">准备工作清单</h2><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-FCkKZZ3n\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-6jbFGoVa\">&nbsp;飞书账号（用于访问Aily工作助手）</li></ul><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-nRtKE6kz\" data-indent=\"1\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-s2nNqj4d\">也可使用其他支持添加MCP Server的模型客户端，例如Cherry Studio、Chatbox等</li></ul><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-0bgIZq7y\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-r2S6tJxH\">&nbsp;确认您已授权需要操作的业务账户（如巨量千川账户）</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-TDtyMuz4\">&nbsp;5分钟配置时间</li></ul><p data-id=\"p838747a-djdysPTw\"><br></p><h2 data-id=\"h490b8bf-QX3NdNbH\" id=\"h490b8bf-QX3NdNbH\">第一步：获取访问权限</h2><p data-id=\"p838747a-3xr0LlHX\">根据所需操作业务账户，可分别参考【<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1847394521222599\" target=\"blank\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">AD业务工具</a>】/【<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/12/docs/1839622960207943\" target=\"blank\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">千川业务工具</a>】授权账户并生成对应API Key</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-Jy5Ks2k1\"><img src=\"https://p3-business-sign.byteadimg.com/tos-cn-i-yvqzo4lhg5/138edf5084024179b426244e0d49fe30~noop.image?rk3s=d3394059&amp;x-expires=2079940264&amp;x-signature=vwgISXRb%2BartUA3e78JHc9su4Jw%3D\" data-auto=\"true\" style=\"width: 2000px; visibility: visible; height: auto;\" data-type=\"inline\"></p><div data-type=\"qzcard\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22borderColor%22%3A%22%23fed4a4%22%2C%22backgroundColor%22%3A%22%23fff5eb%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%3Cp%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22CuHjJ%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%2C%22html%22%3A%22%3Cp%20data-id%3D%5C%22p838747a-JQshMqS7%5C%22%3E%F0%9F%92%A1%20%3Cstrong%3E%E5%B0%8F%E8%B4%B4%E5%A3%AB%3C%2Fstrong%3E%EF%BC%9AAPI%20Key%E5%B0%B1%E5%83%8F%E6%82%A8%E7%9A%84%E6%95%B0%E5%AD%97%E9%92%A5%E5%8C%99%EF%BC%8C%E8%AF%B7%E5%A6%A5%E5%96%84%E4%BF%9D%E7%AE%A1%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E8%A6%81%E5%88%86%E4%BA%AB%E7%BB%99%E4%BB%96%E4%BA%BA%EF%BC%81%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cul%20data-indent%3D%5C%221%5C%22%20data-id%3D%5C%22u738a58b-b4hVhcSH%5C%22%3E%3Cli%20data-id%3D%5C%22ld70c578-uE73611B%5C%22%3EKey%E4%BC%9A%E5%8C%85%E5%90%AB%E5%9C%A8%E7%94%9F%E6%88%90%E7%9A%84URL%E4%B8%AD%EF%BC%8C%E6%A0%BC%E5%BC%8F%E4%B8%BA%E2%80%8B%3Ccode%3E%E2%80%8Bhttps%3A%2F%2Fopen.oceanengine.com%2Fqianchuan%2Fmcp%3FAPI_KEY%3D%7B%E6%82%A8%E7%9A%84Key%7D%E2%80%8B%3C%2Fcode%3E%E2%80%8B%3C%2Fli%3E%3C%2Ful%3E%22%7D\"><div class=\"QZCard-container\" style=\"border-color: #fed4a4;background-color:#fff5eb;\"><div class=\"QZCard-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 1024 1024\" version=\"1.1\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" p-id=\"13148\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\"><path d=\"M833.5 330.5C833.5 153 689.6 7.6 512 7.6S190.5 153 190.5 330.5c0 70.3 37.3 161 97.2 227.9 59.4 66.3 103.5 177.9 103.5 266.9v34.9h241.6v-34.6c0-89 44.1-200.4 103.2-266.9 60.1-67.6 97.5-166.4 97.5-228.2z\" fill=\"#FFC807\" p-id=\"13149\"></path><path d=\"M636.5 790.6l-193.9-268L596.4 202l199.2 266.4c-17.4 36.4-39.3 67.4-63.9 95.2C685.3 621 664.1 671.1 644 741l-7.5 49.6z\" fill=\"#FFB300\" p-id=\"13150\"></path><path d=\"M499.5 378.3h-82.7c-12.6 0-21.4-12.7-16.8-24.5l59.2-153c2.7-6.9 9.4-11.5 16.8-11.5h105c13.6 0 22.3 14.5 15.9 26.5l-81.5 153c-3.2 5.8-9.3 9.5-15.9 9.5z\" fill=\"#FFF8E1\" p-id=\"13151\"></path><path d=\"M466.2 518.3l160-171c12-12.8 2.9-33.7-14.6-33.7h-105c-8.7 0-16.4 5.6-19.1 13.9l-55 171c-6.6 20.4 19.1 35.5 33.7 19.8z\" fill=\"#FFF8E1\" p-id=\"13152\"></path><path d=\"M593.6 1016.4H430.4c-5.7 0-10.9-3.7-14-9.8l-22.2-44.2h235.6l-22.2 44.2c-3.1 6.1-8.3 9.8-14 9.8z\" fill=\"#455A64\" p-id=\"13153\"></path><path d=\"M625.7 980.4H398.3c-22.1 0-40.1-17.9-40.1-40.1V776.7c0-22.1 17.9-40.1 40.1-40.1h227.5c22.1 0 40.1 17.9 40.1 40.1v163.7c-0.1 22.1-18 40-40.2 40z\" fill=\"#ECEFF1\" p-id=\"13154\"></path><path d=\"M539.8 808.6H359v-36h180.8c9.9 0 18 8.1 18 18 0 10-8.1 18-18 18zM359 840.1h306v36H359zM665 943.6H494.8c-9.9 0-18-8.1-18-18s8.1-18 18-18H665v36z\" fill=\"#CFD8DC\" p-id=\"13155\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"QZCard-editor-container\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-JQshMqS7\">💡 <strong>小贴士</strong>：API Key就像您的数字钥匙，请妥善保管，不要分享给他人！</p><ul data-indent=\"1\" data-id=\"u738a58b-b4hVhcSH\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-uE73611B\">Key会包含在生成的URL中，格式为<code>https://open.oceanengine.com/qianchuan/mcp?API_KEY={您的Key}</code></li></ul></div></div></div><h2 data-id=\"h490b8bf-xFMy33wb\" id=\"h490b8bf-xFMy33wb\">第二步：配置MCP Server</h2><p data-id=\"p838747a-Z4wFO6Hy\">飞书Aily配置添加MCP Server操作流程可参考：【<a href=\"https://bytedance.larkoffice.com/wiki/LSyXwyza6iueZxkFZgtcjx4Bnoc\" target=\"blank\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">在aily工作助手中配置MCP服务</a>】</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-Hytpq5Gt\">可根据流程配置自定义服务，也可以在工具添加页面的【服务市场】中搜索【巨量千川】（AD暂时未上线服务市场，可通过自定义方式配置）</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-PvmZcFc3\"><img src=\"https://p3-business-sign.byteadimg.com/tos-cn-i-yvqzo4lhg5/048500d067f04c3b9d6adec942499004~noop.image?rk3s=d3394059&amp;x-expires=2079940860&amp;x-signature=FalXWZqOoihW96irPxM4DDsgsMA%3D\" data-auto=\"true\" style=\"width: 2000px; visibility: visible; height: auto;\" data-type=\"inline\"></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-t7VQKLXd\">添加完成并开启工具后，您可直接向Aily发送业务需求（如“查询我授权的千川账户并按行业分类”），AI会自动调用MCP工具完成任务并返回结果。</p><div data-type=\"qzcard\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22borderColor%22%3A%22%23fed4a4%22%2C%22backgroundColor%22%3A%22%23fff5eb%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%3Cp%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22izdHH%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%2C%22html%22%3A%22%3Cp%20data-id%3D%5C%22p838747a-QCGCzn60%5C%22%3E%E5%A6%82%E6%9E%9C%E9%AA%8C%E8%AF%81%E5%A4%B1%E8%B4%A5%EF%BC%8C%E8%AF%B7%E6%A3%80%E6%9F%A5API%20Key%E6%98%AF%E5%90%A6%E6%AD%A3%E7%A1%AE%EF%BC%8C%E7%A1%AE%E4%BF%9D%E6%82%A8%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%9A%E5%8A%A1%E8%B4%A6%E6%88%B7%E6%9C%89%E7%9B%B8%E5%BA%94%E6%9D%83%E9%99%90%E3%80%82%E5%A6%82%E5%A4%9A%E6%AC%A1%E5%A4%B1%E8%B4%A5%EF%BC%8C%E8%AF%B7%E8%81%94%E7%B3%BB%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%AF%E6%94%AF%E6%8C%81%EF%BC%88%E5%8F%AF%E9%80%9A%E8%BF%87%E5%B7%A8%E9%87%8F%E5%BC%95%E6%93%8E%E5%BC%80%E6%94%BE%E5%B9%B3%E5%8F%B0%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E5%8F%B3%E4%B8%8B%E8%A7%92%E5%A4%84%E7%9A%84%E5%B7%A8%E9%87%8F%E9%97%AE%E9%97%AE%E5%8F%8D%E9%A6%88%EF%BC%89%3C%2Fp%3E%22%7D\"><div class=\"QZCard-container\" style=\"border-color: #fed4a4;background-color:#fff5eb;\"><div class=\"QZCard-icon\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 1024 1024\" version=\"1.1\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" p-id=\"13148\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\"><path d=\"M833.5 330.5C833.5 153 689.6 7.6 512 7.6S190.5 153 190.5 330.5c0 70.3 37.3 161 97.2 227.9 59.4 66.3 103.5 177.9 103.5 266.9v34.9h241.6v-34.6c0-89 44.1-200.4 103.2-266.9 60.1-67.6 97.5-166.4 97.5-228.2z\" fill=\"#FFC807\" p-id=\"13149\"></path><path d=\"M636.5 790.6l-193.9-268L596.4 202l199.2 266.4c-17.4 36.4-39.3 67.4-63.9 95.2C685.3 621 664.1 671.1 644 741l-7.5 49.6z\" fill=\"#FFB300\" p-id=\"13150\"></path><path d=\"M499.5 378.3h-82.7c-12.6 0-21.4-12.7-16.8-24.5l59.2-153c2.7-6.9 9.4-11.5 16.8-11.5h105c13.6 0 22.3 14.5 15.9 26.5l-81.5 153c-3.2 5.8-9.3 9.5-15.9 9.5z\" fill=\"#FFF8E1\" p-id=\"13151\"></path><path d=\"M466.2 518.3l160-171c12-12.8 2.9-33.7-14.6-33.7h-105c-8.7 0-16.4 5.6-19.1 13.9l-55 171c-6.6 20.4 19.1 35.5 33.7 19.8z\" fill=\"#FFF8E1\" p-id=\"13152\"></path><path d=\"M593.6 1016.4H430.4c-5.7 0-10.9-3.7-14-9.8l-22.2-44.2h235.6l-22.2 44.2c-3.1 6.1-8.3 9.8-14 9.8z\" fill=\"#455A64\" p-id=\"13153\"></path><path d=\"M625.7 980.4H398.3c-22.1 0-40.1-17.9-40.1-40.1V776.7c0-22.1 17.9-40.1 40.1-40.1h227.5c22.1 0 40.1 17.9 40.1 40.1v163.7c-0.1 22.1-18 40-40.2 40z\" fill=\"#ECEFF1\" p-id=\"13154\"></path><path d=\"M539.8 808.6H359v-36h180.8c9.9 0 18 8.1 18 18 0 10-8.1 18-18 18zM359 840.1h306v36H359zM665 943.6H494.8c-9.9 0-18-8.1-18-18s8.1-18 18-18H665v36z\" fill=\"#CFD8DC\" p-id=\"13155\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"QZCard-editor-container\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-QCGCzn60\">如果验证失败，请检查API Key是否正确，确保您的业务账户有相应权限。如多次失败，请联系技术支持（可通过巨量引擎开放平台官方右下角处的巨量问问反馈）</p></div></div></div><p data-id=\"p838747a-9fh5rFke\"><br></p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-Z1pomCq3\" id=\"h346b9f0-Z1pomCq3\">实践案例</h1><h2 data-id=\"h490b8bf-KJJLyABu\" id=\"h490b8bf-KJJLyABu\">案例一：智能整理投放账户</h2><p data-id=\"p838747a-enCs6dIY\"><strong>场景描述：</strong>您管理着多个投放账户，需要定期整理和分类，但手动操作既耗时又容易出错。</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-3VyKyK2u\"><strong>示例：</strong>让AI自动查询您的账户信息，并按行业、规模等维度智能分类，最后生成一份清晰的账户管理清单。</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-hdVVpNy0\"><strong>建议Prompt：</strong>“通过巨量千川工具查询我已授权的账户，根据账户类型查询对应的千川投放账户，再通过公开账户信息工具查询投放账户信息，并按所属行业分类。”</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-sYRYf8Th\"><strong>结果示例：</strong></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-JRfuAc2u\"><img src=\"https://p6-business-sign.byteadimg.com/tos-cn-i-yvqzo4lhg5/feea7d41cc054f8fb5e6fe0f0d806328~noop.image?rk3s=d3394059&amp;x-expires=2079941323&amp;x-signature=6ectSCvlnJQ7KoGeAST8bdlFyF0%3D\" data-auto=\"true\" style=\"width: 2000px; visibility: visible; height: auto;\" data-type=\"inline\"></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-4BjgQIhf\"><img src=\"https://p3-business-sign.byteadimg.com/tos-cn-i-yvqzo4lhg5/cb1c919a0f05427e8fb8360c4ad6cb57~noop.image?rk3s=d3394059&amp;x-expires=2079941427&amp;x-signature=%2FSM3qxlNqa%2FS4PzsMDr6WY6VGi8%3D\" data-auto=\"true\" style=\"width: 2000px; visibility: visible; height: auto;\" data-type=\"inline\"></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-m3Bm4YW6\"><img src=\"https://p6-business-sign.byteadimg.com/tos-cn-i-yvqzo4lhg5/a410ce489c4e4637b542d14c9f9c6d9a~noop.image?rk3s=d3394059&amp;x-expires=2079941437&amp;x-signature=9Nr9ucBYAZf0XD9r0XTT0VbxJ78%3D\" data-auto=\"true\" style=\"width: 2000px; visibility: visible; height: auto;\" data-type=\"inline\"></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-MwI98NwK\">⚠️ <strong>常见问题处理</strong></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-TFqwlWAU\"><strong>Q1：某些账户没有显示怎么办？</strong></p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-6007zxbD\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-nGRcAwUG\">检查生成API Key对应授权的账号下是否包含这些账户的权限，确认账户状态是否正常并重新授权相关账户</li></ul><p data-id=\"p838747a-oyuHZzQp\"><strong>Q2：分类结果不准确怎么办？</strong></p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-eDyteeVj\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-LulIOO2w\">可以手动调整分类规则，提供更详细的分类标准，让AI学习您的分类偏好</li></ul><p data-id=\"p838747a-hhQ0KaCl\"><br></p><h2 data-id=\"h490b8bf-Qrnd0V5u\" id=\"h490b8bf-Qrnd0V5u\">案例二：营销投放数据分析</h2><p data-id=\"p838747a-5ZTAInwZ\"><strong>场景描述：</strong>您需要定期分析投放效果，但数据分散在不同报表中，手动分析工作量大。</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-AAYKF2sb\"><strong>示例：</strong>自动获取指定账户的投放数据，AI进行深度分析并生成优化建议报告。</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-MTxmlaJr\"><strong>建议Prompt：</strong>“查询xxx投放账户近7天的投放账户报表数据，分析投放效果情况。”</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-7oMilwcw\"><strong>结果示例：</strong></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-IDcDYFKh\"><img src=\"https://p6-business-sign.byteadimg.com/tos-cn-i-yvqzo4lhg5/98b8ee7f7c14416f9c5fa2c00be3959f~noop.image?rk3s=d3394059&amp;x-expires=2079941588&amp;x-signature=FH%2BdyAASEAb39YnAEisqaDxyQCw%3D\" data-auto=\"true\" style=\"width: 2000px; visibility: visible; height: auto;\" data-type=\"inline\"></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-zpgh3TUO\"><img src=\"https://p26-business-sign.byteadimg.com/tos-cn-i-yvqzo4lhg5/a3876e14825b47ec890754acbe6785da~noop.image?rk3s=d3394059&amp;x-expires=2079941600&amp;x-signature=IIdVYQuMmZBirWUv9OeIc8MCUpY%3D\" data-auto=\"true\" style=\"width: 2000px; visibility: visible; height: auto;\" data-type=\"inline\"></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-pviwPBpz\">⚠️ <strong>常见问题处理</strong></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-DCnbWujn\"><strong>Q1：分析结论可靠性怎么样？</strong></p><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-lm1GqDFx\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-BvhOyrKm\">MCP Server只是提供数据获取的能力，使用以及数据结果的分析依赖于配合模型，建议初期可以对比验证AI分析结果</li></ul><p data-id=\"p838747a-x1IMj1FU\"><br></p><h2 data-id=\"h490b8bf-iDHtzfpq\" id=\"h490b8bf-iDHtzfpq\">案例三：智能报告生成</h2><p data-id=\"p838747a-yxBXL2tI\"><strong>场景描述：</strong>您需要定期向领导汇报投放业务情况，但整理数据和制作报告占用大量时间。</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-DCyy55RK\"><strong>示例：</strong>基于您的业务数据，自动生成专业的分析报告，包含关键指标、趋势分析和建议。</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-nMDM5GOP\"><strong>建议Prompt：</strong>“基于xxx账户近7天的投放数据，生成周度投放效果报告，包含核心指标趋势和优化建议。”</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-cCCaQT15\"><strong>结果示例：</strong></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-5XD14eM7\"><img src=\"https://p3-business-sign.byteadimg.com/tos-cn-i-yvqzo4lhg5/67927c31aa1b41b2abb65caf00373543~noop.image?rk3s=d3394059&amp;x-expires=2079941782&amp;x-signature=VqBiO858H6GDAd8Lzub7rxrDZ8Q%3D\" data-auto=\"true\" style=\"width: 2000px; visibility: visible; height: auto;\" data-type=\"inline\"></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-nMs8GRDa\"><br></p><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-Ije08Rml\" id=\"h346b9f0-Ije08Rml\">最佳实践</h1><h2 data-id=\"h490b8bf-X3BppBcl\" id=\"h490b8bf-X3BppBcl\">Prompt编写技巧</h2><h3 data-id=\"h6f20189-R5Tndjc6\" id=\"h6f20189-R5Tndjc6\">基本原则</h3><ol data-id=\"o9d5df12-jAQCXWAJ\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-mgLhrZZv\">明确具体：清楚地说明您想要什么</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-6wMy5dzR\">分步说明：复杂任务分解为多个步骤</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-n7Fqe2n3\">提供背景：给出必要的上下文信息</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-1BEl1Ic8\">指定格式：说明希望的输出格式</li></ol><h3 data-id=\"h6f20189-Kw55MUwX\" id=\"h6f20189-Kw55MUwX\">优秀Prompt示例</h3><p data-id=\"p838747a-BLOygVuC\">✅ 好的Prompt：</p><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view qz-codeblock qz-card-type-block\" data-type=\"codeblock\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22wrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22language%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22theme%22%3A%22QZtheme%22%2C%22height%22%3A%22auto%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%E8%AF%B7%E5%B8%AE%E6%88%91%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90%E5%B9%BF%E5%91%8A%E8%B4%A6%E6%88%B7%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%EF%BC%8C%E6%8C%89%E4%BB%A5%E4%B8%8B%E6%AD%A5%E9%AA%A4%EF%BC%9A%5Cn1.%20%E6%9F%A5%E8%AF%A2%E8%BF%917%E5%A4%A9%E7%9A%84%E6%80%BB%E6%B6%88%E8%80%97%E5%92%8C%E6%80%BB%E6%94%B6%E7%9B%8A%5Cn2.%20%E8%AE%A1%E7%AE%97%E6%AF%8F%E6%97%A5%E7%9A%84ROI%E5%8F%98%E5%8C%96%E8%B6%8B%E5%8A%BF%5Cn3.%20%E6%89%BE%E5%87%BA%E8%A1%A8%E7%8E%B0%E6%9C%80%E5%A5%BD%E7%9A%843%E4%B8%AA%E5%B9%BF%E5%91%8A%E7%BB%84%5Cn4.%20%E6%8F%90%E5%87%BA3%E4%B8%AA%E5%85%B7%E4%BD%93%E7%9A%84%E4%BC%98%E5%8C%96%E5%BB%BA%E8%AE%AE%5Cn%E8%AF%B7%E4%BB%A5%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC%E5%BD%A2%E5%BC%8F%E5%B1%95%E7%A4%BA%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22hI3d6%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%7D\"><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view_contain qz-codeblock_inner\"><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view_scroll qz-codeblock-scroll\" style=\"height: auto; max-height: 600px; overflow-y: scroll;\"><div class=\"qz-codeblock_content plain\"></div></div></div></div><p data-id=\"p838747a-VBCNsUHC\">❌ 需要改进的Prompt：</p><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view qz-codeblock qz-card-type-block\" data-type=\"codeblock\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22wrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22language%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22theme%22%3A%22QZtheme%22%2C%22height%22%3A%22auto%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%E5%B8%AE%E6%88%91%E7%9C%8B%E7%9C%8B%E5%B9%BF%E5%91%8A%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22I4Yx6%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%7D\"><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view_contain qz-codeblock_inner\"><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view_scroll qz-codeblock-scroll\" style=\"height: auto; max-height: 600px; overflow-y: scroll;\"><div class=\"qz-codeblock_content plain\"></div></div></div></div><h2 data-id=\"h490b8bf-RZAcVJDS\" id=\"h490b8bf-RZAcVJDS\">实用模板</h2><p data-id=\"p838747a-0eJHew6p\">数据分析模板：</p><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view qz-codeblock qz-card-type-block\" data-type=\"codeblock\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22wrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22language%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22theme%22%3A%22QZtheme%22%2C%22height%22%3A%22auto%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%E8%AF%B7%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90%E3%80%90%E8%B4%A6%E6%88%B7%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4%E3%80%91%E5%9C%A8%E3%80%90%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%E6%AE%B5%E3%80%91%E7%9A%84%E3%80%90%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E7%B1%BB%E5%9E%8B%E3%80%91%EF%BC%8C%E9%87%8D%E7%82%B9%E5%85%B3%E6%B3%A8%EF%BC%9A%5Cn1.%20%E3%80%90%E6%8C%87%E6%A0%871%E3%80%91%E7%9A%84%E5%8F%98%E5%8C%96%E8%B6%8B%E5%8A%BF%5Cn2.%20%E3%80%90%E6%8C%87%E6%A0%872%E3%80%91%E7%9A%84%E5%AF%B9%E6%AF%94%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90%20%20%5Cn3.%20%E3%80%90%E6%8C%87%E6%A0%873%E3%80%91%E7%9A%84%E6%8E%92%E5%90%8D%E6%83%85%E5%86%B5%5Cn4.%20%E6%8F%90%E5%87%BA%E3%80%90%E6%95%B0%E9%87%8F%E3%80%91%E4%B8%AA%E6%94%B9%E8%BF%9B%E5%BB%BA%E8%AE%AE%5Cn%E8%BE%93%E5%87%BA%E6%A0%BC%E5%BC%8F%EF%BC%9A%E3%80%90%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC%2F%E5%9B%BE%E8%A1%A8%2F%E6%96%87%E5%AD%97%E3%80%91%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Q0lzd%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%7D\"><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view_contain qz-codeblock_inner\"><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view_scroll qz-codeblock-scroll\" style=\"height: auto; max-height: 600px; overflow-y: scroll;\"><div class=\"qz-codeblock_content plain\"></div></div></div></div><p data-id=\"p838747a-KEyLVte9\">报告生成模板：</p><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view qz-codeblock qz-card-type-block\" data-type=\"codeblock\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22wrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22language%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22theme%22%3A%22QZtheme%22%2C%22height%22%3A%22auto%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%E8%AF%B7%E5%9F%BA%E4%BA%8E%E3%80%90%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E6%BA%90%E3%80%91%E7%94%9F%E6%88%90%E3%80%90%E6%8A%A5%E5%91%8A%E7%B1%BB%E5%9E%8B%E3%80%91%EF%BC%8C%E5%8C%85%E5%90%AB%EF%BC%9A%5Cn1.%20%E3%80%90%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%E6%AE%B5%E3%80%91%E7%9A%84%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E6%80%BB%E7%BB%93%5Cn2.%20%E4%B8%8E%E3%80%90%E5%AF%B9%E6%AF%94%E6%9C%9F%E9%97%B4%E3%80%91%E7%9A%84%E5%AF%B9%E6%AF%94%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90%5Cn3.%20%E3%80%90%E6%95%B0%E9%87%8F%E3%80%91%E4%B8%AA%E6%9C%80%E4%BD%B3%E5%AE%9E%E8%B7%B5%E6%A1%88%E4%BE%8B%5Cn4.%20%E4%B8%8B%E9%98%B6%E6%AE%B5%E7%9A%84%E3%80%90%E6%95%B0%E9%87%8F%E3%80%91%E4%B8%AA%E5%BB%BA%E8%AE%AE%5Cn%E7%9B%AE%E6%A0%87%E5%8F%97%E4%BC%97%EF%BC%9A%E3%80%90%E6%B1%87%E6%8A%A5%E5%AF%B9%E8%B1%A1%E3%80%91%22%2C%22id%22%3A%226IFg7%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%7D\"><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view_contain qz-codeblock_inner\"><div class=\"qz-codeblock_view_scroll qz-codeblock-scroll\" style=\"height: auto; max-height: 600px; overflow-y: scroll;\"><div class=\"qz-codeblock_content plain\"></div></div></div></div><h1 data-id=\"h346b9f0-knq7xQp2\" id=\"h346b9f0-knq7xQp2\">数据安全注意事项</h1><div class=\"table-container qz-card-type-block\"><table class=\"data-table data-table-row-header\" data-id=\"t3945309-Fg9VUBTl\" data-custom=\"false\" data-transient-attributes=\"class\" style=\"width: 100%; outline: none; border-collapse: collapse; max-width: 100%;\" data-width=\"100%\"><colgroup data-id=\"c7104f7d-DYf22iQj\"><col span=\"1\" data-id=\"c0bb105d-SQRQUk14\" width=\"33.33333333333333%\"><col span=\"1\" data-id=\"c0bb105d-MjJ4Ap6c\" width=\"33.33333333333333%\"><col span=\"1\" data-id=\"c0bb105d-070f1OjV\" width=\"33.33333333333333%\"></colgroup><tbody data-id=\"t6d5e859-nSAROlNF\"><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-BbZRP7JW\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-V1ANf7b3\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-S7AxdUtP\"><strong>API Key保护</strong></p></td><td data-id=\"t8c0e6ab-a6eWWLW8\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-xt5UdYdv\"><strong>数据权限管理</strong></p></td><td data-id=\"t1b895c3-0aV284nm\" class=\"table-last-row\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-B3B7Kqkj\"><strong>敏感信息处理</strong></p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t31e458f-kAkkfdom\" style=\"height: 30px;\"><td data-id=\"t1c8f800-OO854YD4\" class=\"table-last-column\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-lpSpgGY4\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-PffZe55e\">不要在公共场合分享</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-3ncZRTu3\">定期更换密钥</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-lpmWRakF\">使用专用账户授权</li></ul></td><td data-id=\"t1c8f800-l2Mfamhl\" class=\"table-last-column\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-0gaLCqFZ\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-lICh7IcW\">只授权必要的账户权限</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-iw08D19t\">定期检查授权范围</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-li5Ye3eB\">及时撤销不需要的权限</li></ul></td><td data-id=\"t0513538-gCGIjUSm\" class=\"table-last-row table-last-column\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><ul data-id=\"u738a58b-0LghGj5q\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-Udb3issX\">避免在对话中透露密码</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-yeV6hph0\">重要数据先脱敏再分析</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-40sym8M3\">及时清理历史对话记录</li></ul></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p data-id=\"p838747a-J4VUfjmu\"><br></p></div>",
